[Advent of Code](https://adventofcode.com) is a famous website that releases one programming puzzle each day, starting from the 1st and usually ending on the 25th (like an advent calendar). This year, only 12 puzzles will be released. While this is sad news for many Advent of Code enjoyers like me, I think this gives me an opportunity to finish every day's puzzle for the first time. 

